  "historyNote": "#5008, eff 11-27-90, EXPIRED: 11-27-96 New. #6867, eff 10-9-98; ss by #8727, INTERIM, eff 10-9-06, EXPIRED4-7-07 New. #8868, eff 4-19-07; (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for He-E 700) #10179, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13600, eff 3-24-23",
